Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: NEW transparent CHARACTER ANIMATION SOURCE for Cầm Long Công. Identity lock to supplied APPROVED Cái Bang Bổng atlas: identical chibi face, dark ponytail/red ribbons, red short layered tunic, ivory collar/wrist wraps, dark trousers, brown shoes, plain brown staff. No redesign, no armor, no fire/VFX/aura, no background/shadow/text/grid. True transparentPNG.
Exactly FOUR columns x THREE rows,12 different poses,1536x1024. Equal384x341cells, wide spacing, characters within their own cells. Keep character BODY about200px sourceheight and consistent acrossall12. Feet centerlocalx192 andbaseliney285ineachrow. Elevated orthographic three-quarter TOP-DOWN RPG camera. No front-facing eyes in side/back views.
4 sequential poses of ONE channel/pull technique, staff remains continuously gripped in NON-CASTING hand and never disappears:
1 grounded preparation, staff low across/back of hips in one hand, other empty open hand near chest;
2 windup, torso twists slightly, empty palm draws backward, staff hand stable;
3 release, open palm extends firmly forward at chestheight with fingers visible and separated, staff still low in otherhand;
4 pull/recovery, extended open hand retracts toward chest with bent elbow, body leans back slightly, staff retained. No new weapon, no stabbing, no hands merging with staff.
ROW1 allDOWN/front; ROW2 allUP/back with ponytail consistent and castingarm extending away; ROW3 allLEFT with open palm extended screenLEFT and staff hand behind hip. Right will be mirrored in production. Distinct deliberate arm/torso changes amongall4frames. Allfeet fully visible and samebody scale, no duplicate static pose. Refined crisp pixelclusters at4x native detail, not blurred painted rendering.
